<title>USA: Tele-Communications names Malone chairman.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications names Malone chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc said on Monday it had named John Malone to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>Malone, who will continue as chief executive and president, replaces TCI's chairman and founder Bob Magness, who died on November 15.</p>
